-- =============================================================================
-- Longblack — Multi-Store Test Seed Data
-- Script: 007-multi-store-test-seed.sql
--
-- Run order: 001-catalogue-schema.sql, 005-multi-store-transfers-schema.sql,
-- and 006-product-variant-test-seed.sql must all be run first (this script
-- depends on the 90 test product variants and the seeded Warehouse store).
--
-- Purpose: FOR TESTING ONLY. Adds two extra Stores alongside the seeded
-- Warehouse, and gives the Warehouse starting Inventory (qty 50) for every one
-- of the 90 test variants from 006, so Stock Transfers can actually be
-- drafted/dispatched/received against real data in the UI.
--
-- How to run against a local PostgreSQL database:
--   psql -U <user> -d <database> -f db/007-multi-store-test-seed.sql
--
-- This script is idempotent: each INSERT uses ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING so rows
-- are only inserted when they do not already exist. It is safe to run multiple
-- times without duplicating data.
--
-- The starting Inventory is modelled as a real, Received Goods Receipt (not a
-- bare INSERT into inventory) so the "Inventory is always derived from
-- InventoryTransactions" invariant holds for seed data exactly as it does for
-- data created through the app — see CONTEXT.md.
--
-- Seed user: rows are attributed to 'system' as the created_by/updated_by value.
-- =============================================================================

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Extra Stores — id block 0007 (continues after the Warehouse's ...001)
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Seed Goods Receipt — id block 0008 (header) / 0009 (lines)
-- A single Received receipt bringing 50 units of every test variant into the
-- Warehouse, so the receipt itself is visible in the Goods Receipts UI too.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Warehouse Inventory — id block 000a
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Matching InventoryTransactions (immutable ledger) — id block 000b
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
